Even if there is no table path, we may still need one PhysicalTableScan. For example:
```
create table tbl(id int primary key, a int, b int, c int, key idx_a(a), key idx_b(b));
select * from tbl where a < 1 or b > 1;
```
we need additional table scan to get column c.

How about:
```golang
if partPath.isTablePath {
    scan, partialCost, rowCount = ds.convertToPartialTableScan(prop, partPath)
} else {
    scan, partialCost, rowCount = ds.convertToPartialIndexScan(prop, partPath)
}
scans = append(scans, scan)
totalCost += partialCost
totalRowCount += rowCount
```
